{"unit_id":"libinyam__dsh-vision-provider#card-zh","repo":"libinyam/dsh-vision-provider","commit":"c4c76c2a2a69313b91728dcde2827e014aad7c72","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-provider（DSH Web 插件）：为 DeepSeek 会话加入可选择的视觉模型组合。它注册一个组合模型提供方，枚举 Harness 中声明支持图片的模型，也提供 OpenAI-compatible 直连视觉端点；含图消息先交给选定视觉模型生成描述，再由 DeepSeek 完成推理、工具调用和最终回答。纯文字消息仍直接交给 DeepSeek。它还支持视觉请求超时、错误映射和进程内分析缓存，适合希望在 Web 会话中让 DeepSeek 使用图片内容的用户。需要 DeepSeek 凭据和视觉服务凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:336-360","src/index.js:405-426","src/index.js:744-824","cordis.patch.yml:18-28"]}
{"unit_id":"libinyam__dsh-vision-provider#card-en","repo":"libinyam/dsh-vision-provider","commit":"c4c76c2a2a69313b91728dcde2827e014aad7c72","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-provider adds selectable vision models to DSH Web with DeepSeek. It discovers configured image models or uses an OpenAI-compatible endpoint. The vision model describes images for DeepSeek to answer. Text-only messages go directly to DeepSeek. Requires credentials for both services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:336-360","src/index.js:405-426","src/index.js:744-824","cordis.patch.yml:18-28"]}
